{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/8c18f078ab69dcf78410258c34e343d4.avif?t=1753700935\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/6edbf1a0ea8aef1111328822845e7f61.avif?t=1753700935\" /></div><br>Alone on Mars, you awaken with nothing but your suit and a handful of supplies. Every breath, every drop of water, and every spark of energy must be carefully managed as you fight to survive on a planet that wants you gone - you navigate the harsh realities of life on the Red Planet.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/c6bcaddd9c476cd30944a77f237f4bfc.poster.avif?t=1753700935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/c6bcaddd9c476cd30944a77f237f4bfc.webm?t=1753700935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/c6bcaddd9c476cd30944a77f237f4bfc.mp4?t=1753700935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/b53db1de360c254d0b6adf353766e6b9.avif?t=1753700935\" /></div><br>Start small and dream big. Expand your outpost with life-support systems, storage units, and advanced research modules. Every upgrade increases your odds of long-term survival, letting you transform a fragile shelter into a thriving Martian base.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850980/extras/b3169fc95738abc4099df4b84c4f7f15.poster.avif?t=1753